# --- CONFIGURATION ---
# Copy the live tokens printed in your gateway terminal and paste them below:
@user_token = PASTE_LIVE_USER_TOKEN_HERE
@admin_token = PASTE_LIVE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Request public endpoint anonymously (Tier: anonymous - Capacity: 5)
# Send this rapidly 6 times in a row to hit 429 Too Many Requests
GET http://localhost:8080/users/profile/1

### 2. Request as a Basic User (Tier: basic - Capacity: 10)
# Send this rapidly 11 times to hit 429 Too Many Requests
GET http://localhost:8080/users/profile/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 3. Request as a Premium User (Tier: premium - Capacity: 30)
# Send this rapidly 31 times to hit 429
GET http://localhost:8080/users/profile/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}